B.1.1. INTRODUCTION 
B.1.1.1. Part B of Well-managed Highway Infrastructure covers specific issues and 
themes regarding highways themselves, and includes the following asset types: 
 carriageways; 
 footways; 
 public rights of way; 
 cycle routes; 
